o despierta la imaginació de su hijo, que comienza a dejarse llevar por juegos de fantasía cada vez más intensos. Éstos van inquietando a Laura cada vez más, hasta el punto en el que llega a pensar que hay algo en la casa que está amenazando a su familia. A ella le ocurre algo extraordinario y, a pesar de que es una mujer con unos principios muy claros, su universo se tambalea poniendo en duda todo aquello en lo que creía...","tagline":"Un cuento de amor. Una historia de terror."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ccbiVLk3Mjv9JWBE91vyKj6sTkT.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g6pNnKmvTkNlEvn0ScwstYvhFE.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":6537,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ccbiVLk3Mjv9JWBE91vyKj6sTkT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ccbiVLk3Mjv9JWBE91vyKj6sTkT.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ccbiVLk3Mjv9JWBE91vyKj6sTkT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ccbiVLk3Mjv9JWBE91vyKj6sTkT.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1TMNCU75NXZ0NdsX5ttmtsgvXlV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1TMNCU75NXZ0NdsX5ttmtsgvXlV.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":2920},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wmIXdLNLblj4l1bqgWHLuLbf3ls.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wmIXdLNLblj4l1bqgWHLuLbf3ls.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":2920},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rv4l3fUJqvQlN13HPzbnAx6gSni.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rv4l3fUJqvQlN13HPzbnAx6gSni.jpg","language":"it","width":1500,"height":2190},{"type":"po